pullRef.description:
pull_ref is a pull request's ref as its forge serves it (refs/pull/<n>/head, GitLab's
 refs/merge-requests/<n>/head), fetched once ref is cloned and checked out as pr-<n> or mr-<n>;
 empty for a workspace that opens at ref itself.

x-enum-descriptions:
Its machine is shutting down, and then what its disk wrote since its last commit is
 uploaded to the bucket. A stop stays here until the upload is done, and says why it is not;
 `spin workspace stop --force` does not wait for it.

tags.description:
LogService is what the installation logged, as its store of logs and traces keeps it
 (internal/logstore). Every search is confined by the control plane to what the caller may see;
 what the caller types is searched inside that and cannot widen it.
